{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"拓扑场论"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"拓扑场论"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>一个<strong>拓扑场论</strong> (topological field theory) 是由"},{"Local":{"url":"配边范畴","text":"配边范畴"}},{"Plain":"出发, 取值于某个"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 的一个幺半函子.</p>\n<p>通常 $\\mathcal C$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶模","text":"高阶线性范畴"}},{"Plain":", 即线性空间范畴 $\\mathsf{Vect}_k$ 的高阶类比.</p>\n"}]}}